      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the pressure\" or \"stopping\"... it feels like that's the only thing that would actually work. everything else requires so much energy that i just don't have. i wonder if it's even possible to find real peace when you're this empty. like, is there actually a way to just... stop the noise without it being a constant fight?",
